Package: winsharemanager
Version: @VERSION@
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: qianwei <qianwei@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.8), python3-tk, policykit-1 | polkitd
Recommends: samba, vsftpd, minidlna, openssh-server
Suggests: ufw, firewalld
Homepage: https://github.com/qianweighost/WinShareManager
Description: SMB / WebDAV / FTP / SFTP / DLNA sharing manager with Apple-style GUI
 WinShareManager manages LAN file sharing protocols from one window:
 samba, a built-in WebDAV server (systemd unit), vsftpd, sshd and minidlna.
 Designed for Ubuntu / Debian and CachyOS / Arch (see PKGBUILD for Arch).
